{
  "dom_id": "step-e10453",
  "name": "Example: Finding a Covariance Matrix Given Some Moments",
  "problem": "Consider two random variables $X$ and $Y$ with expectations $\\textrm{E}[X] = 4,$ $\\textrm{E}[Y] = 3,$ mixed moment $\\textrm{E}[XY] = 9,$ and second raw moments $\\textrm{E}[X^2] = 18$ and $\\textrm{E}[Y^2] = 14.$ Find the covariance matrix for $X$ and $Y.$",
  "worked_solution": "For two random variables $X$ and $Y,$ the covariance matrix $\\Sigma$ is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274885/assets/328bbd0bdf3f4483dff24c065f1015d37500fd61385915412a72d4577c135b9c.svg)\n\nRecall that the variance of a random variable $X$ is determined by the formula\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Var}[X] = \\textrm{E}[X^2] - \\textrm{E}[X]^2,\n$$\n\nand the covariance of two random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given by the formula\n\n$$\n\\textrm{Cov}[X,Y] = \\textrm{E}[XY] - \\textrm{E}[X] \\cdot \\textrm{E}[Y].\n$$\n\nFirst, let's find $\\textrm{Var}[X]{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X] & =\\text{E}[{X}^{2}]-\\text{E}[X]^{2} \\\\  & =18-{4}^{2} \\\\  & =2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSimilarly,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[Y] & =\\text{E}[{Y}^{2}]-\\text{E}[Y]^{2} \\\\  & =14-{3}^{2} \\\\  & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow lets find $\\textrm{Cov}[X,Y]{:}$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Cov}[X,Y] & =\\text{E}[XY]-\\text{E}[X]\\cdot \\text{E}[Y] \\\\  & =9-4\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the covariance matrix is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/foundations/14274885/assets/5f6891aca72ec04efdb0e0cbd30cb1ac9cd4a95839f43ff2a2749320a35df939.svg)",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e10453\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Finding a Covariance Matrix Given Some Moments</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e10453\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                